\par +1\tab Spell includes unusual action (singing, clapping, etc.)
\par +2\tab Spell requires dramatic action (shattering gem or breaking item, capering
\par \tab  and dancing, shouting, etc.)
\par +4\tab Spell requires very obvious action (a full religious ritual, drawing a circle
