\par \tab An improved version of the }{\i\fs24 infravision }{\fs24 spell, }{\i\fs24 ultravision }{\fs24 
allows the spell recipient to see perfectly in normal darkness, starlight, or moonlight to the full range of his unobscured daylight vision. (See Chapter 13 of the }{\i\fs24 Player\rquote s Handbook}{\fs24 
; in most outdoor settings, this means that the character can s
pot movement at 1,500 yards.) In underground settings, the spell enables the recipient to see up to 90 feet in nonmagical darkness. Magical darkness, fog, or smoke is less effective than normal against a character using }{\i\fs24 ultravision}{\fs24 
; the spell permits the recipient to see at least 30 feet in magical darkness, and at least 10 feet in any kind of vaporous, foggy, or smoky atmosphere. }{\i\fs24 Ultravision }{\fs24 
does not permit the recipient to spot invisible creatures, and it does not function in the presence of strong light sources (lanterns, torches, and so on).
