\par \tab By using this spell, the wizard renders inert and makes breathable any harmful vapors, gases, clouds, or fogs in the area of effect. This includes }{\i\fs24 stinking cloud, cloudkill, solid fog, death fog, incendiary cloud, acid storm, }{\fs24 
