inate, or exercise other forms of mental control against the recipient are automatically blocked by this spell.
\par \tab }{\i\fs24 Protection from chaos }{\fs24 also wards the recipient against contact with extraplanar creatures of chaotic origin, including tanar\rquote ri, slaad, and eladrin. Unlike }{\i\fs24 protection from evil}{\fs24 
, this spell does not necessarily guard against summoned or conjured creatures unless the creatures in question are chaotic in alignment. However, }{\i\fs24 protection from chaos }{\fs24 does protect the recipient from creatures influenced b
y confusion and chaos spells and effects. The natural or bodily attacks of such creatures automatically fail, as long as the recipient does not use the spell\rquote 
s power to trap, pin, or drive back the chaotic creatures in question. The spell ends if the recipient makes a melee attack against creatures that are prevented from attacking him by this spell.
