\par \tab This divination reveals the presence of disembodied or noncorporeal spirits of all types, including wraiths, ghosts, spectres, astrally\_projecting creatures, characters or monsters employing }{\i\fs24 magic jar }{\fs24 
or possession, and (of course) animal spirits and spirits of nature. Characters or monsters who are simply }{\i\fs24 invisible, phased}{\fs24 , or }{\i\fs24 ethereal }{\fs24 
do not count as spirits, since they are physically present in the flesh despite their unusual status. The caster detects spirits in a path 10 feet wide and 60 feet long; any within the area of effect are revealed in their preferred form or appearance f
