nd damage rolls, but it can strike creatures normally hit only by +4 or better weapons. As an incarnation of elemental earth, the mace inflicts up to twice the damage (roll twice the required damage dice) against creatures of elemental air or magical avia
ns such as griffons, perytons, pegasi, and winged baatezu or tanar\rquote ri. The }{\i\fs24 adamantite mace }{\fs24 retains its special properties for one round per level of experience of the caster.
