\par \tab When a priest casts this spell, a green ray springs from his outstretched hand and unerringly strikes a creature within line of sight and the range of the spell, covering t
he subject with a shimmering emerald field that completely blocks bodily extradimensional travel. Forms of movement barred by the }{\i\fs24 dimensional anchor }{\fs24 include }{\i\fs24 
blinking, dimension door, etherealness, gate, phasing, plane shift, maze, shadow walk, teleportation, }{\fs24 and similar spell\_
like or psionic abilities. The field persists for one turn plus one round per caster level and has no effect other than blocking extradimensional travel. The }{\i\fs24 dimensional anchor }{\fs24 does not interfere with the movement of creatures in astra
l form, nor does it block extradimensional perception or attack forms such as a basilisk\rquote s gaze.
