\par \tab This spell enhances the natural hardiness and stamina of the affected creatures by rendering them virtually immune to fatigue or exhaustion. During the casting of the spell, the caster must touch each creature to be affected. While under the spell
\rquote s influe
nce, the subjects may force march with no penalty, engage in up to 12 hours of hard labor per day with no fatigue (or up to 16 hours with moderate fatigue), and gain a +4 bonus to Strength/Stamina or Constitution/Fitness checks. In addition, the subjects 
gain a +4 bonus to saving throws against spells or magical effects that cause }{\i\fs24 weakness, fatigue}{\fs24 , or }{\i\fs24 enfeeblement}{\fs24 . Finally, an affected creature\rquote s fatigue rating (from }{\i\fs24 Player\rquote 
