\par \tab This spell allows the priest to issue a }{\i\fs24 command }{\fs24 to any one creature within the spell\rquote s range. The magic of the spell translates the priest\rquote s order into a language or form the subject cre
ature can understand. The creature must have an Intelligence of at least 1 in order to be affected by this spell; nonintelligent creatures (those with a score of 0) cannot comprehend any order, no matter how the priest phrases it. Other creatures gain a s
aving throw vs. spell to resist }{\i\fs24 command monster}{\fs24 , but only if they have an Intelligence of Exceptional (15) or better, or the creature\rquote s levels or Hit Dice are equal to or greater than the caster\rquote s.
\par \tab Just like the 1st\_level spell }{\i\fs24 command}{\fs24 , this spell coerces the subject into obeying the priest\rquote s one\_
