\par \tab In the PHB, clerics have major access to all, astral, charm, combat, creation, divination, guardian, healing, necromantic, protection, summoning, sun, and minor access to elemental.
\par \tab }{\b\fs24 Revision: Clerics lose access to sun, elemental air, and elemental fire. They retain minor access to elemental water and elemental earth.
\par }{\fs24 \tab Previously, druids had major access to all, animal, elemental, healing, plant, weather, and minor access to divination.
\par \tab }{\b\fs24 Revision: Druids lose access to the sphere of divination. They gain major access to the sphere of sun.
\par }{\fs24 
